      "writtenOn": "2026-09-16T05:37:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the case you mentioned is specified as `Functionality` degraded.\nHowever, I think that case has already been covered by the PDI in the following link:\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/blob/261c11dd50d9c96e558abb848512f8f4f7c613b3/yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/State/Decorator/OperationalStatus.interface.yaml#L4",
