      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-02T01:22:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am wondering what would be conditions/guidelines which will qualify something as being degraded as by its meaning its really subjective, isn\u0027t it.\n\nIn other words, how would the expected level of an object be defined for this purpose ?",
      "parentUuid": "c015a763_b89988d2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 7,
