      "message": "Now users of this interface must support this property and it\u0027s also a bit unclear what this should be set to when functional\u003dfalse. I wonder if it\u0027s better to just define this property in specific interfaces. Can you elaborate where all you intend to implement this interface?",
      "parentUuid": "6d75d1fe_70611d4a",
      "range": {
