      "message": "Understood your concern and I have moved the property to a new interface instead of the existing one, to avoid affecting the current consumer.\n\nIn addition, I have moved the property to new interfaces named `Degradation` as I see this is similar to that of `Availability` and should be fine to be used to represent if the object is operated under degraded functional or performance.",
